n.\n\nReason:\nI must PASS. The landlord has only 1 card left. By passing, my teammate\'s ♠A wins this trick, and my teammate gets to lead the next round with 4 cards remaining. This gives us control and prevents the landlord from potentially playing their last card and winning. Taking control myself would be disastrous as it gives the landlord (with 1 card) the next opportunity to play.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
